    tcg: Preserve dispatch lookup inlining with the opt-in probe
    
    Attach always_inline only in optimized probe-enabled builds so optional counter and timing paths cannot make GCC outline the ordinary lookup wrapper. Preserve the compile-disabled definition and all validation, accounting, clear and lifetime behavior. Qualify emitted code and matched OFF/counters runs before claiming a performance improvement.

